      gamesTitle: "СПИСОК ИГР",
      textHtml: `<h3>Everyone is Special</h3><p>When I was young, everything that went wrong in my house seemed to be my fault. Once, my brothers tried to make cookies. They <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="смешали">blended</span> <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="муку">flour</span> and <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="имбирь">ginger</span> and made a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="отвратительную">disgusting</span> <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="пасту, массу">paste</span>. Then they tried to wash it down the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="слив, водосток">drain</span>, but it got all over the floor. Later, my brothers said that I did it and I had to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="вытереть">wipe</span> it up.</p><p>I worried that my parents liked them more than me. One <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="осенним">autumn</span> day, I was sure I would make my parents proud. I bought a model rocket. After I put it together, I invited everybody to watch it. I wanted my brothers to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="завидовали">envy</span> my technical knowledge. I lit the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="фитиль">fuse</span>, but nothing happened.</p><p>“Looks like your <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="фейерверки">fireworks</span> don’t work. I hope you kept the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="чек">receipt</span> so you can return them,” my brother said.</p><p>“It’s not fireworks!” I screamed. They were making fun of me again.</p><p>I didn’t know what went wrong. I hadn’t <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="изменял">altered</span> anything. I quickly moved the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="провода">wires</span> on the bottom, hoping that would help. Suddenly, the rocket flew up. We stood <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="в стороне">aside</span> as it <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="изгибалась, летела по дуге">curved</span> through the lawn and ran straight into the mailbox. Then the mailbox <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="развалился, рухнул">collapsed</span>. The rocket was <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="раздавлена, разбита">crushed</span>.</p><p>Embarrassed, I ran inside and hid. A few minutes later, my mom asked, “Are you OK?”</p><p>“I just wanted them to be <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="завидовали">jealous</span> of me for once. Now I see why you and Dad don’t love me as much as them,” I said.</p><p>“That’s not true!” said my mom. “See my fingers . . . each one is different. You kids are like my fingers: all are different, but I love them all the same.”</p><p>I <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="обнял">embraced</span> her. Now I know that my parents love me just as much as my brothers.</p>`,
      videoUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/vKSvg9Kcj9I",
      keywordsList: [{ word: "alter", translation: "изменять, менять" }, { word: "aside", translation: "в сторону, в стороне" }, { word: "autumn", translation: "осень" }, { word: "blend", translation: "смешивать, сочетать" }, { word: "collapse", translation: "рушиться, обваливаться" }, { word: "crush", translation: "крушить, раздавливать" }, { word: "curve", translation: "изгибаться, гнуть" }, { word: "disgusting", translation: "отвратительный, мерзкий" }, { word: "drain", translation: "водосток, слив" }, { word: "embrace", translation: "обнимать, охватывать" }, { word: "envy", translation: "завидовать" }, { word: "fireworks", translation: "фейерверк, салют" }, { word: "flour", translation: "мука" }, { word: "fuse", translation: "фитиль, предохранитель" }, { word: "ginger", translation: "имбирь" }, { word: "jealous", translation: "завистливый, ревнивый" }, { word: "paste", translation: "паста, клей" }, { word: "receipt", translation: "чек, квитанция" }, { word: "wipe", translation: "вытирать, протирать" }, { word: "wire", translation: "проволока, провод" }],
